    {
      "id": "jGB7ew5s-BUBt8xW_SB8E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 361.50961065288436,
      "y": -241.9498788836355,
      "width": 894.5592651367188,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b01",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1751508356,
      "version": 462,
      "versionNonce": 1654860292,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783718369801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirement\n\n1. Responsiveness: The component should be responsive and supported across all devices \nand screen sizes\n2. Search result highlighting should be configurable, enhancing the user experience \nby making it easier to identify relevant suggestions.\n3. API Flexibility: support both client vs server API confirguation\n4. Inifinite scrolling\n5. Edge case handling (reliability + consistency)\n6. offline usage (reading from cache)\n7. User experience: loading/error/success state/clear commmunication in component status, \na11y & i18n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirement\n\n1. Responsiveness: The component should be responsive and supported across all devices \nand screen sizes\n2. Search result highlighting should be configurable, enhancing the user experience \nby making it easier to identify relevant suggestions.\n3. API Flexibility: support both client vs server API confirguation\n4. Inifinite scrolling\n5. Edge case handling (reliability + consistency)\n6. offline usage (reading from cache)\n7. User experience: loading/error/success state/clear commmunication in component status, \na11y & i18n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kcXL-WE-aUN-C4vpqCTcY",
      "type": "rectangle",
